==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{ON.|is}} {{term|þykkr|lang=non}} from {{proto|Germanic|thekuz|lang=is}}. Whence also Old High German {{term|dicki|lang=goh}}.

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|[[þykkari]] '''''or''''' [[þykkri]]|þykkastur}}

